    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1079">

                <pb facs="0805" n="729" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg729"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/1357</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Special Representative Rodgers
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-08-23T19:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 23, 1916, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>316. Mining companies must know by Saturday next whether extension will be
                    granted to pay last tercio’s taxes.</p>
                <p>Renew your efforts to obtain extension and telegraph result not later than Friday
                    night.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
